<section style="padding:3rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border)"><div style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.5rem"><h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem);font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text);margin-bottom:1.5rem">Why Partner with SDF Clothing?</h2><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Linen production runs through our own cutting and sewing floor, with fabric sourced directly rather than through a buying house adding a markup on top of mill pricing. Most of our linen sits in the 160-180 GSM range, the weight most summer garments call for, with heavier and lighter options available by request. GOTS, OEKO-TEX Standard 100, BSCI, WRAP, and ISO 9001 certification applies.</p><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Linen's structured drape and natural wrinkling come from the low elasticity of the flax fiber itself, not a manufacturing defect — something we brief buyers on upfront so finished garments match expectations. Minimum order starts at 300 pieces per style, with fabric sourcing, sampling, bulk manufacturing, quality inspection, and export documentation handled in-house.</p><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Bangladesh's LDC graduation takes effect in November 2026, but nothing changes at the border immediately: the EU has committed to duty-free treatment under Everything But Arms through 2029, and Washington capped tariff exposure at 20% in a late-2025 agreement. For linen specifically, that keeps landed cost manageable on a fabric that already carries higher raw-material cost than cotton.</p><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:2rem">Ready to start? <a href="/contact/" style="color:var(--color-primary)">Request a sample</a> or <a href="/contact/" style="color:var(--color-primary)">contact our team</a> for a detailed FOB quote within 48 hours.</p></div></section>
